*comment ==================================================
*comment  Vampire Ability Selector
*comment  Usage:  *gosub_scene vampire_abilities "commoner"
*comment          *gosub_scene vampire_abilities "knight"
*comment          *gosub_scene vampire_abilities "baron"
*comment ==================================================

*params rank
*temp picks 0

*if (rank = "commoner")
  *goto rank_commoner
*elseif (rank = "knight")
  *goto rank_knight
*elseif (rank = "baron")
  *goto rank_baron
*else
  *comment unexpected rank
  *return

*label rank_commoner
As a newly acknowledged **Commoner**, choose **two** gifts:

*label commoner_menu
*choice
  *if (night_vision = false) #Night Vision – see in perfect darkness.
    *set night_vision true
    *set perception +10
    *set picks +1
  *if (blood_sense = false)  #Blood Sense – feel every heartbeat nearby.
    *set blood_sense true
    *set awareness +10
    *set picks +1
  *if (fledgling_charm = false) #Fledgling’s Charm – subtle influence.
    *set fledgling_charm true
    *set charm +10
    *set picks +1
  *if (veil_of_shadows = false) #Veil of Shadows – melt into darkness.
    *set veil_of_shadows true
    *set stealth +10
    *set picks +1
*if (picks < 2)
  You have chosen *picks* of 2 abilities.
  *goto commoner_menu
Power surges through your fledgling veins.
*return


*label rank_knight
The **Knight** rank grants you one advanced discipline. Choose wisely:

*choice
  #Combat Mastery – superior weapon skill.
    *set combat_mastery true
    *set combat +10
  #Shadow Step – near-instant short teleport.
    *set shadow_step true
    *set stealth +10
  #Blood Bond – empower allies with your vitae.
    *set blood_bond true
    *set charm +10
Your knighthood is sealed in crimson.
*return


*label rank_baron
Elevated to **Baron/Baroness**, select one aristocratic art:

*choice
  #Blood Alchemy – transmute vitae into poisons or elixirs.
    *set blood_alchemy true
    *set awareness +10
  #Sanguine Shield – conjure a barrier of hardened blood.
    *set sanguine_shield true
    *set combat +10
  #Shadow Veil – cloak nearby allies in darkness.
    *set shadow_veil true
    *set stealth +10
Your noble power resonates through the night.
*return
*label rank_viscount
*comment Viscount/Viscountess Abilities (Inherits Baron/Baroness, Knight, and Commoner abilities)
The **Viscount/Viscountess** rank grants you mastery over the most potent vampire arts. Choose one:
*choice
  #Umbral Weapons – forge weapons from pure shadow.
    *set umbral_weapons true
    *set combat +10
  #Blood Alchemy Mastery – create powerful elixirs and poisons.
    *set blood_alchemy true
    *set awareness +10
  #Sanguine Shield Mastery – enhance your protective barrier.
    *set sanguine_shield true
    *set combat +10
    #Shadow Veil Mastery – extend your cloak to shield allies.
    *set shadow_veil true
    *set stealth +10
Your viscountcy is a testament to your mastery of the night.
*return
*label rank_duke
*comment Duke/Duchess Abilities (Inherits Viscount/Viscountess, Baron/Baroness, Knight, and Commoner abilities)
The **Duke/Duchess** rank signifies your dominion over the vampire courts. Choose one of these powerful abilities:
*choice
  #Aura of Majesty – command respect and fear.
    *set aura_of_majesty true
    *set charm +10
  #Eclipse – shroud the battlefield in darkness.
    *set eclipse true
    *set stealth +10
  #Crimson Storm – unleash a tempest of blood magic.
    *set crimson_storm true
    *set combat +10
  #Shadow Dominion – bend shadows to your will.
    *set shadow_dominion true
